":"cna-rl","title":"CNA: 高捷小港林園線全線發包 (2026-10-22)","url":"https://cna.com.tw/news/aloc/202610220127.aspx","accessed":"2026-11-14"},{"id":"newtalk-rl","title":"Newtalk: 小港林園線 RLC02 award (2026-05-08)","url":"https://newtalk.tw/news/view/2026-05-08/1033937","accessed":"2026-11-14"},{"id":"housefeel-yellow","title":"Housefeel: 高雄捷運黃線 explainer (updated 2026-11-04)","url":"https://www.housefeel.com.tw/article/%E9%AB%98%E9%9B%84%E6%8D%B7%E9%81%8B%E9%BB%83%E7%B7%9A-%E9%AB%98%E6%8D%B7%E9%BB%83%E7%B7%9A-%E6%8D%B7%E9%81%8B%E9%BB%83%E7%B7%9A-%E9%AB%98%E6%8D%B7%E9%83%BD%E6%9C%83%E7%B7%9A/","accessed":"2026-11-14"},{"id":"wiki-yellow","title":"Wikipedia (zh): 高雄捷運黃線","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/zh-tw/高雄捷運黃線","accessed":"2026-11-14"},{"id":"pts-thsr-pt","title":"PTS News: 高鐵延伸屏東 環評與期程 (2025)","url":"https://news.pts.org.tw/article/783729","accessed":"2026-11-14"}],"notes":"Geometry and station positions © OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL (KMRT and LRT from route relations; TRA and THSR routed on the OSM track network; simplified ~15 m). Covers Kaohsiung plus the Pingtung commuter corridor, clipped to lng 120.15-120.55 / lat 22.45-22.92 (THSR is shown to Tainan). Interchanges are merged when stations share a name within ~450 m, and official transfers with different names are merged explicitly (Zuoying / Xinzuoying, Kaisyuan / Cianjhen Star, Hamasen / Sizihwan). TRA and THSR have no official per-line colours: TRA lines use TRA navy and a second blue for branches, THSR uses its brand orange. Years of TRA sections are historic opening years. The Circular LRT opened in stages 2015-2024 (loop closed 2024-01-01). Projects: Red Line Gangshan-Lujhu phase 2A (construction, end-2029) and 2B (approved, 2031), Siaogang-Linyuan line (construction, 2034), Yellow Line (priority section under construction, 2032; rest approved/contracted, 2034), THSR extension to Pingtung (proposed, ~2039). Future station names are working names and their positions are approximate. Not included: Purple Line (feasibility study under review), Red Line extension Linyuan-Linbian to Pingtung (feasibility under review), Yellow Line Cianjhen fishing-port spur (under evaluation)."}